  state "S-D03-027-01 대기" as idle
  state "S-D03-027-02 요청중" as request
  state "S-D03-027-03 archive검증" as archive
  state "S-D03-027-04 설치" as installed
  state "S-D03-027-05 거부" as refused
  state "S-D03-027-06 취소" as cancelled
  [*] --> idle
  idle --> request: explicit start and all gates
  request --> archive: valid response and current connected location
  archive --> installed: save checked and current connected location again
  request --> refused: transport or validation or location failure
  archive --> refused: storage failure or disconnected current fix
  request --> cancelled: generation or session invalidated
  archive --> cancelled: response token invalidated
  installed --> request: explicit replacement preserves installed route
  refused --> request: explicit retry
